<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites tender for combined wheat cargo.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites tender for combined wheat cargo.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Friday invited tenders for the supply of a combined cargo of 10,000 tonnes of spring and 8,000 tonnes of durum wheat.</p>
<p>The tender closes next Friday, March 28, a statement from the commission said. The shipment period should be between April 5 and 20, it added.</p>
</text>
